# Secrets never enter Git (parent plan Section 20.4 item 3; MT-5.1-01 risk
# note). The WP-5.1 stack takes the tunnel token from infra/compose/.env
# (git-ignored) only, but guard this folder too: a locally-managed tunnel's
# credentials file or a stray env file must never be committed.
*.json
.env
credentials*.json
